00:01:09.337 --> 00:01:11.370 line:84%
CHERRY RAE: Return to the booth
during a designated time slot

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:13.350 line:84%
to check out the official
Marvel's Avengers

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:15.150 line:84%
