00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.460 line:84%
But five years later,
the world is in peril.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.780 line:90%
Superheroes are outlawed.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:34.800 line:90%
What's our only hope?

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:37.040 line:84%
To reassemble earth's
mightiest heroes.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.430 line:84%
Cherry, I love all
these costumes.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.260 line:84%
I love all this, but I
want to go to the theater.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.280 line:84%
I gotta see more.
You ready?

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.252 line:90%
CHERRY RAE: I am so excited.

00:01:42.252 --> 00:01:43.185 line:90%
RYAN PENAGOS: Let's do this.

00:01:43.185 --> 00:01:44.490 line:90%
CHERRY RAE: So excited.

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:45.700 line:90%
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:46.800 line:84%
CHERRY RAE: When
